  "seoBody": "<h2>Your records stay in the EU</h2><p>Quickler holds your data on EU servers in Germany and handles it in line with GDPR. That covers answers, voice notes, photos and reports.</p><p>You get a clear answer when a client, auditor or data protection officer asks where the data goes.</p><h2>You use WhatsApp</h2><p>You answer each question by text, voice note or photo. Nothing to install. No login on site.</p><p>When you say done, Quickler writes the report from what you sent.</p><h2>Any country, any kind of check</h2><p>Send us your own form or report. Quickler fills it in from what you say, send and photograph. See the <a href=\"/pages/global-field-compliance.html\">global field compliance overview</a>.</p><h2>Questions</h2><h3>Where is my data stored?</h3><p>On EU servers in Germany, handled in line with GDPR.</p><h3>Do I need a new app?</h3><p>No. You answer in WhatsApp by text, voice note or photo. Nothing to install.</p><h3>Can I use forms from outside the UK?</h3><p>Yes. Upload your own form and Quickler turns it into a WhatsApp Check.</p><h3>What do I get at the end?</h3><p>A report in Word, PDF or a web link. Each Fault is listed with its place and becomes a job.</p><p>Read our <a href=\"/pages/guides.html\">guides</a>, try the <a href=\"/pages/demo.html\">demo</a>, or <a href=\"/pages/help/index.html#contact-form-section\">contact us</a>.</p>",
